{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1122403001:1":{"text":"俺たちはお前を信じてたんだぞ！なのにお前は……！","source_cn":"银喙，我们以前那么信任你，结果你是怎么对我们的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82A92DB217437F27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122403002:1":{"text":"危険な仕事は全部俺たちにやらせた挙げ句、みんなで苦労して稼いだ金を持ち逃げして、自分だけいい目見やがって！","source_cn":"每次都把最危险最累的事甩给兄弟，最后还卷走我们的辛苦钱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39D6FE6BE80D7CAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122403003:1":{"text":"ふざけるな！俺がいつ金を持ち逃げしたってんだ！？","source_cn":"少胡说八道！我没卷走你们的钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE564ED4BD2D6894F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1122403004:1":{"text":"最初から俺を信用してなかったくせに！この分からず屋どもが！","source_cn":"你们当初就不相信我，直到现在，还是这副德行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6F93D1E8768026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122403005:1":{"text":"なんだって！？俺たちが依頼の報酬を持ち帰るたびに取り分を要求しやがって！","source_cn":"哼，不管我们完成了什么委托，只要拿回酬金来，你就一定要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x249CD03151B28F43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122403006:1":{"text":"それはまだいい！でも箱の中に入れておいた金はどう説明する！？あれもお前が持って行ったんだろ！","source_cn":"这也就算了！但是放在箱子里的那些血汗钱，不也都是被你拿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x395A3EEA17B2F502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1122403007:1":{"text":"でたらめを言うな！シルバービークは一度も俺の金を取ったことなんてないぞ！","source_cn":"——放屁！我和银喙结伴这么久，从没见他拿过我的钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA32B3C9E0D01FBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122403008:1":{"text":"バカめ！それはお前が気付いてないだけだ！","source_cn":"蠢货！他要是想拿又怎么可能被你发现！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABC0261BF475F6F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1122403009:1":{"text":"さっき、こいつが金を数えてるのを見たんだ！俺が止めてなきゃ、とっくに金を持って逃げてたにちがいねぇ！","source_cn":"刚才我来的时候，他就在数钱！要不是被我拦下，他早就卷钱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FBE823B538E7999","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1122403009":{"text":"さっき、こいつが金を数えてるのを見たんだ！俺が止めてなきゃ、とっくに金を持って逃げてたにちがいねぇ！","source_cn":"刚才我来的时候，他就在数钱！要不是被我拦下，他早就卷钱跑路了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FBE823B538E7999","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1122403010:1":{"text":"そうだ！何年も前に相棒をやめたくせに、今になって金を要求してくる奴の話なんて信用できるか！","source_cn":"说得没错！你和银喙好几年前就翻脸了，现在才来讨债，谁信啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8112E46223D545E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1122403013:1":{"text":"俺だって何年も前のことをいまさら掘り返したくはなかったさ。","source_cn":"是，都过去这么多年了，我本来不想追究。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2110E407C8DF98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1122403014:1":{"text":"だがこいつはエーベルトに金を返したんだろ！だったら俺たちの金も返すべきだ！","source_cn":"可银喙还了艾伯特的帐，也该还上欠我们的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8324A808C4BF0BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"根拠のない言いがかりだ！","source_cn":"别污蔑人！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A15787D2BEBC6DA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"根拠のない言いがかりだ！","female":"根拠のない言いがかりよ！","variant_male_record_index":"64610","variant_female_record_index":"64611","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1122403011:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、こいつの話を真に受けるな！","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3EB7B59FFE2D7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、こいつの話を真に受けるな！","female":"<style=\"stres